== Trivia ==
* The pickup quote of this item is a reference to an infamous line from the first [[wikipedia:Resident Evil|Resident Evil]] game.
* {{dlc+|r}} Paper Clip is the only Beggar payout (coming from the {{M|Key Master}}) that is not a passive/active item. While {{M|Rotten Beggar}}s and {{M|Battery Bum}}s can also pay with trinkets, they do so as random drops, rather than payout.{{dlc-}}

